1763:Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32h7xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         - ADC external channel (channel connected to a GPIO pin):
1764:Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32h7xx_ll_adc.h ****   *           LL_ADC_CHANNEL_1, LL_ADC_CHANNEL_2, ...
