3398:Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32h7xx_ll_adc.h **** /**
3399:Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32h7xx_ll_adc.h ****   * @brief  Get for the ADC selected offset number 1, 2, 3 or 4:
