1791:Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_adc_ex.c ****       (+) Enter ADC deep-power-down mode
1792:Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_adc_ex.c **** 
